%% React Aria — full flow
%% Pure Mermaid. No Markdown fence.

flowchart TD
    trigger([Building or reviewing an interactive component]) --> behav{Does it have BEHAVIOUR?<br/>focus · keyboard nav · overlay<br/>· selection · validation}

    behav -->|no — purely presentational| own[Build it outright.<br/>Avatar, Card, Badge, Skeleton, ScrollArea<br/>have no RAC primitive and need none]
    behav -->|yes| rac{Does RAC have a primitive?}

    rac -->|yes| use[Use the RAC component.<br/>NEVER hand-roll focus trap, roving tabindex,<br/>typeahead, dismissal or live regions]
    rac -->|no| hooks[Escape hatch: react-aria HOOKS.<br/>Document WHY RAC was insufficient]

    rac -.API, props, examples.-> adobe[(Adobe skill<br/>+ /llms.txt — the LIVE API)]

    use --> style[Style with OUR tokens:<br/>render-prop className · data-* attrs<br/>· slot · @plugin tailwindcss-react-aria-components]
    hooks --> style
    own --> style

    style --> form{Is it a FORM FIELD?}

    form -->|yes| rhf["Drive it through RHF Controller<br/>+ validationBehavior='aria'<br/>← or RAC's native validation fights Zod"]
    form -->|no| instr

    rhf --> instr[Wrap with OUR instrumentation:<br/>analyticsId prop, error boundary<br/>— wired in the primitive, never per feature]

    instr --> bar{Component quality bar<br/>— all nine dimensions?}

    bar -->|keyboard/screen-reader gaps| check{Is the gap something<br/>RAC should have supplied?}
    check -->|yes| misuse[You are fighting the primitive —<br/>re-read its API before patching around it]
    check -->|no — contrast, copy, alt text,<br/>heading order, colour-alone| ours[Fix it. RAC never supplied these;<br/>they are ours in every component]
    misuse --> use
    ours --> bar

    bar -->|passes| done([Done: RAC behaviour, our pixels,<br/>one validator, instrumented once])

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class behav,rac,form,bar,check gate
    class trigger,done terminal
